+# CLAUDE.md
+
+This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.
+
+## Project Overview
+
+**ArcheOne** (internal name: **XOne**) is a Kotlin-based Android enterprise management application built with Jetpack Compose. It provides employee services, facility management, safety features, and administrative tools for organizational operations.
+
+**Key Features:**
+- Employee Services: Business Cards, Holiday Calendar, Policies, Greetings, Global Celebrations
+- Facility Management: Meeting Room booking (Meet Space), Stationary ordering (Desk Cart), Inventory, Asset Management
+- Safety & Support: SOS (Emergency), Chat Support, Raise Concerns, Ticket Tracking
+- Security: Biometric Authentication, MPIN setup, secure document viewing
+- Travel Management: Travel approvals, history, and admin dashboard
+- Announcements (HeadsUp): Create/view/manage company-wide posts
+
+## Build Commands
+
+**CRITICAL**: This environment requires specific `JAVA_HOME` configuration for all Gradle commands.
+
+### Build the App
+```powershell
+$env:JAVA_HOME="C:\Program Files\JetBrains\IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3.1.1\jbr"; ./gradlew assembleDebug
+```
+
+### Install to Device
+```powershell
+$env:JAVA_HOME="C:\Program Files\JetBrains\IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3.1.1\jbr"; ./gradlew installDebug
+```
+
+### Clean Build
+```powershell
+$env:JAVA_HOME="C:\Program Files\JetBrains\IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3.1.1\jbr"; ./gradlew clean
+```
+
+### Lint Code
+```powershell
+$env:JAVA_HOME="C:\Program Files\JetBrains\IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3.1.1\jbr"; ./gradlew ktlintCheck
+```
+
+### Format Code
+```powershell
+$env:JAVA_HOME="C:\Program Files\JetBrains\IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3.1.1\jbr"; ./gradlew ktlintFormat
+```
+
+### Tests
+No unit or instrumented tests exist yet, though the test infrastructure is configured (JUnit, Espresso, Compose UI testing dependencies are present).
+
+## Architecture
+
+### Pattern: Modified MVVM with Controllers
+
+The app uses a **Controller-based architecture** that differs from traditional Android MVVM:
+
+- **Controllers** (`controller/`): Business logic layer that manages state using Compose's `mutableStateOf` and Kotlin `StateFlow`. Controllers handle API calls, data transformation, and navigation. Unlike ViewModels, they're instantiated directly in Activities/Screens. There are ~60 controllers.
+
+- **Screens** (`ui/screens/`): Jetpack Compose UI layer. Screens are composable functions that observe controller state and render UI. There are ~90 screen composables plus 38+ Activity-based screens.
+
+- **Models** (`model/`): Data classes representing API responses, requests, and domain objects.
+
+- **Network Layer** (`network/`):
+  - `RetrofitClient.kt`: Singleton Retrofit instance. **Must call `RetrofitClient.initialize(context)` before use** (done in `XOneApplication.onCreate()`). Base URL: `https://archeone.arche.global/`. Timeouts: 30s.
+  - `ApiService.kt`: Retrofit interface defining all API endpoints
+  - `EncryptedAPIService.kt`: RSA/AES encrypted API communication (120s timeout)
+  - `AuthInterceptor` (inside RetrofitClient.kt): Adds auth tokens and handles 401 expiration. **Skips auth for URLs containing** `send-otp` or `otpVerify`.
+
+All source paths below are relative to `app/src/main/java/com/archeGlobal/one/`.
+
+### Navigation: Dual System
+
+The app uses two navigation mechanisms in parallel during migration to Compose:
+
+1. **Compose Navigation** (`NavHost` in `MainActivity.kt`): Routes include `welcome`, `home`, `locations`, `business_card`, `core_values`. Business card route uses custom slide animations.
+
+2. **Activity-based Navigation** via `Navigator` interface (`navigation/Navigator.kt`, 60+ methods) implemented by `AndroidNavigator.kt` (753 lines). Uses Intent-based launches with custom slide animations.
+
+When adding a new feature, decide whether it belongs as a Compose route in `NavHost` or as a new Activity. Most recent features use Compose routes. Legacy features use Activities declared in `AndroidManifest.xml`.
+
+### State Management
+
+Controllers use two approaches:
+1. **Compose State**: `mutableStateOf` for simple UI state that triggers recomposition
+2. **StateFlow**: `MutableStateFlow`/`StateFlow` for complex state, async operations, and data streams
+
+### Singleton Managers
+
+- **`UserDataManager`** (`utils/UserDataManager.kt`): Singleton managing user session data in-memory plus persistent storage. Uses callback system (`onDataReady`) to notify when user data is loaded. Manages service URLs, HeadsUp counts, profile picture updates.
+- **`PreferencesManager`** (`utils/PreferencesManager.kt`): Encrypted SharedPreferences wrapper (560 lines). Manages auth tokens, user settings, favorites, service configs, app lock state (as StateFlow), install type tracking (NEW vs UPDATE), and "new" service sticker tracking.
+- **`ProfileController`**: Uses a static method to link with `HomeController` for real-time profile picture updates across screens.
+- **`SocialDataProvider`**: Preloads social feed data at app startup in `XOneApplication`.
+
+### App Initialization Order (`XOneApplication.onCreate()`)
+
+1. Register `AppLifecycleObserver` for background/foreground tracking
+2. Force font scale to 1.0f (overrides system font size for UI consistency)
+3. Initialize `RetrofitClient` singleton
+4. Initialize `UserDataManager` singleton
+5. Preload social data in background coroutine
+
+### Authentication & Session
+
+- `PreferencesManager`: Encrypted SharedPreferences for auth tokens and settings
+- `UserDataManager`: In-memory user session cache with persistent backup
+- `BiometricHelper`: Device credential/biometric authentication
+- `MpinManager` (`ui/screens/MpinManager.kt`): MPIN validation
+- **Session expiration**: On 401, `AuthInterceptor` clears session but preserves MPIN credentials, biometric settings, and last user data (email, mobile, employeeId, name) for seamless re-authentication. Redirects to `LoginActivity` with `session_expired: true`.
+
+### Entry Point Flow
+
+`SplashActivity` (manifest alias: `SplashAlias`) -> 2s delay -> checks:
+1. `PreferencesManager.isFirstLaunch()` → true: `OnboardingActivity`
+2. `UserDataManager.isLoggedIn()` → true: `HomeActivity`, false: `LoginActivity`
+
+All screens are portrait-only. Security screens (MPIN, Splash) explicitly lock orientation.
+
+## Configuration
+
+### Build Config
+- **compileSdk**: 36, **minSdk**: 26, **targetSdk**: 35
+- **JVM Target**: 11
+- **Namespace**: `com.archeGlobal.one`
+- **Version**: versionCode 23, versionName "1.8"
+- **ktlint**: Abort on error enabled. Wildcard imports allowed (`.editorconfig`: `ktlint_disabled_rules = no-wildcard-imports`)
+- **NDK**: Filters for armeabi, armeabi-v7a, arm64-v8a, x86, x86_64
+
+### Dependencies
+Managed via Gradle version catalog (`gradle/libs.versions.toml`):
+- Jetpack Compose (Material 3) with Compose BOM
+- Retrofit + OkHttp + Gson for networking
+- Coil for image loading
+- Coroutines for async operations
+- Accompanist for pager and swipe-refresh
+- Lottie for animations
+- Room for local database
+- CameraX + MLKit for barcode scanning (Meet Space QR check-in)
+- Google Generative AI integration
+- AndroidX Security Crypto for encrypted SharedPreferences
+- Kotlin 2.0.0, AGP 8.12.0
+
+## Development Patterns
+
+### Adding a New Feature
+
+1. **Create Model** (if needed): Add data classes in `model/` for API requests/responses
+2. **Define API Endpoint**: Add to `ApiService.kt`
+3. **Create Controller**: In `controller/`, extend similar controller or create new one
+4. **Create Screen**: In `ui/screens/`, create composable function
+5. **Add Navigation**: Update `Navigator` interface and `AndroidNavigator` implementation, or add Compose route to `NavHost`
+6. **Register Activity** (if Activity-based): Add to `AndroidManifest.xml`
+
+### Controller Pattern
+
+```kotlin
+class MyFeatureController(
+    private val navigator: Navigator,
+    private val context: Context,
+) {
+    var isLoading by mutableStateOf(false)
+
+    private val _data = MutableStateFlow<MyData?>(null)
+    val data: StateFlow<MyData?> = _data.asStateFlow()
+
+    fun loadData() {
+        CoroutineScope(Dispatchers.IO).launch {
+            isLoading = true
+            try {
+                val response = RetrofitClient.apiService.getData()
+                _data.value = response
+            } catch (e: Exception) {
+                // Handle error
+            } finally {
+                isLoading = false
+            }
+        }
+    }
+}
+```
+
+### Screen Pattern
+
+```kotlin
+@Composable
+fun MyFeatureScreen(controller: MyFeatureController) {
+    val data by controller.data.collectAsState()
+
+    LaunchedEffect(Unit) {
+        controller.loadData()
+    }
+
+    if (controller.isLoading) {
+        // Show loading
+    } else {
+        // Show content
+    }
+}
+```
+
+### API Calls
+
+All API calls automatically include auth token via `AuthInterceptor`. For endpoints that shouldn't include auth (like OTP), the interceptor skips them based on URL pattern matching (`send-otp`, `otpVerify`).
+
+### Encryption
+
+Use `EncryptedAPIHelper` for sensitive payloads:
+```kotlin
+val encryptedPayload = EncryptedAPIHelper.createEncryptedPayload(context, payload)
+RetrofitClient.encryptedApiService.submitData(encryptedPayload)
+```
+
+### Edge-to-Edge Display
+
+`MainActivity` is configured for edge-to-edge with transparent system bars. Screens should handle insets appropriately using Compose modifiers.
+
+### Font Scale
+
+The app forces font scale to 1.0f globally (`FontScalingUtils`) to ensure consistent UI regardless of system accessibility settings. This is enforced in `XOneApplication` and re-applied on configuration changes.
+
+## Main Branches
+
+- `main`: Production branch
+- `Development`: Active development branch (current)
